# The built action bundle. GitHub Actions runs `action.yml`'s `main:` path
# directly from whatever ref a consumer checks out, so this can't be built
# on demand the way a published package would be — it has to already exist
# at that ref. Rather than commit it (and its diff noise) to every commit on
# main, the release workflow builds it and publishes it to a dedicated
# `releases/vN` branch/tag instead. See .github/workflows/release.yml and
# the "Releasing" section in README.md.
dist/index.js
